control: The policies' shared load answers a caller only with a load that started after it asked, shared with the callers waiting when it started
removes: each caller runs a load of its own, so a burst of callers runs a burst of loads
packages: ./process/policies
tests: TestCallersWaitingTogetherShareOneLoad TestLoadsRunOneAtATime
scheduled-count: no

